      "content": {
        "summary": "change:20261101-itw-c7b-package-prices why = \"The operator ruled that a stored drink-package price includes the gratuity, and that the gratuity can go stale and must be marked so. The site held package prices in two files that disagreed (Bottomless Bubbles at 9.50 against 11.99, both before a 20 percent gratuity) with no rule for which figure was what.\"",
